# Replace this placeholder with your actual Neon database connection string
# Obtain this from your Neon Console at https://console.neon.tech
# Example: postgresql://neondb_owner:npg_AbCdEf123456@ep-solitary-river-a59z2y0w.us-east-2.aws.neon.tech/neondb?sslmode=require
